00:00:11.285 --> 00:00:13.119
OF CRIMINAL ANTIFA PROTESTERS

00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:15.255
SHOWED UP OUTSIDE HIS HOME LAST

00:00:15.256 --> 00:00:16.823
NIGHT, CHANTING THREATS AGAINST

00:00:16.824 --> 00:00:18.158
HIM AND HIS FAMILY.

00:00:18.159 --> 00:00:21.227
THEY VANDALIZE HIS PROPERTY.

00:00:21.228 --> 00:00:21.995
TUCKER WASN'T HOME BUT HIS WIFE

00:00:21.996 --> 00:00:22.262
WAS.

00:00:22.263 --> 00:00:24.397
WHEN THE GROUP STARTED BANGING

00:00:24.398 --> 00:00:26.566
