00:00:29.770 --> 00:00:31.204
SHE WAS ABOUT TO BE A VICTIM OF

00:00:31.205 --> 00:00:32.172
A HOME INVASION.

00:00:32.173 --> 00:00:34.240
D.C. POLICE ARE INVESTIGATING

00:00:34.241 --> 00:00:36.810
THE INCIDENT AS A HATE CRIME.

00:00:36.811 --> 00:00:38.778
THERE ARE MORE DETAILS IN THIS.

00:00:38.779 --> 00:00:42.449
APPARENTLY THERE WAS ONE

00:00:42.450 --> 00:00:44.017
PROTESTER CAUGHT MENTIONING A

00:00:44.018 --> 00:00:45.852
PIPE BOMB AMONG OTHER DETAILS ON

00:00:45.853 --> 00:00:49.222
THE FRONT DOOR BEING BROKEN.

00:00:49.223 --> 00:00:50.790
&gt;&gt; Dana: ALL OF US KNOW TUCKER

00:00:50.791 --> 00:00:52.992
AND SUSIE, WHO IS ONE OF THE

00:00:52.993 --> 00:00:54.594
MOST WONDERFUL WOMEN, TO IMAGINE

00:00:54.595 --> 00:00:56.062
IN YOUR MIND'S EYE WHAT IT WAS

00:00:56.063 --> 00:00:56.863
LIKE FOR HER, HOW SCARY THAT

00:00:56.864 --> 00:00:59.265
MIGHT HAVE BEEN AND TO HIDE IN

00:00:59.266 --> 00:01:01.234
YOUR HOME AND NOT KNOW WHAT WAS

00:01:01.235 --> 00:01:01.601
HAPPENING.

00:01:01.602 --> 00:01:02.302
I UNDERSTAND HIS BROTHER WAS

00:01:02.303 --> 00:01:05.105
THERE PRETTY QUICKLY.

00:01:05.106 --> 00:01:06.840
THESE PEOPLE ARE SUCH COWARDS.

00:01:06.841 --> 00:01:10.810
IT'S DISTRESSING AND I KNOW THAT

00:01:10.811 --> 00:01:13.546
IF IT WAS THE OTHER WAY AROUND,

00:01:13.547 --> 00:01:14.481
THAT SOMEBODY ON THE LEFT THAT

00:01:14.482 --> 00:01:16.416
HAD A TALK SHOW TO HAVE THIS

00:01:16.417 --> 00:01:18.318
HAPPEN TO THEM AT THEIR HOUSE,

00:01:18.319 --> 00:01:19.819
TUCKER CARLSON WILL BE THE FIRST

00:01:19.820 --> 00:01:20.887
TO DEFEND THEM AND DEFEND THEM

00:01:20.888 --> 00:01:22.222
STRONGLY.

00:01:22.223 --> 00:01:24.224
I HOPE OTHER PEOPLE WELL.

00:01:24.225 --> 00:01:27.460
I WANT TO MENTION FOX NEWS, THE

00:01:27.461 --> 00:01:29.195
CEO AND PRESIDENT PUT OUT A

00:01:29.196 --> 00:01:29.863
STATEMENT SAYING HOW

00:01:29.864 --> 00:01:30.597
REPREHENSIBLE IT WAS.

00:01:30.598 --> 00:01:32.699
AND THAT WE AS A NATION HAVE

00:01:32.700 --> 00:01:34.000
BECOME FAR TOO INTOLERANT OF

00:01:34.001 --> 00:01:35.168
DIFFERENT POINTS OF VIEW AND

00:01:35.169 --> 00:01:36.636
THAT RECENT EVENTS ACROSS THE

00:01:36.637 --> 00:01:38.438
COUNTRY CLEARLY HIGHLIGHT THE

00:01:38.439 --> 00:01:40.273
NEED FOR A MORE CIVIL,

00:01:40.274 --> 00:01:41.074
RESPECTFUL AND INCLUSIVE

00:01:41.075 --> 00:01:41.641
NATIONAL CONVERSATION.

00:01:41.642 --> 00:01:43.143
THEY SAY ALSO THAT THOSE OF US

00:01:43.144 --> 00:01:46.212
IN THE MEDIA AND POLITICS, A

00:01:46.213 --> 00:01:48.047
VERY SPECIAL OBLIGATION TO ALL

00:01:48.048 --> 00:01:49.816
AMERICANS TO FIND COMMON GROUND.

00:01:49.817 --> 00:01:51.651
THAT WAS THERE A STATEMENT

00:01:51.652 --> 00:01:51.951
TODAY.

00:01:51.952 --> 00:01:53.853
&gt;&gt; Dagen: HOW DO YOU PUT A

00:01:53.854 --> 00:01:54.287
STOP TO IT?

00:01:54.288 --> 00:01:58.992
