WITH THE PEOPLE IN THE STREET

00:02:33.460 --> 00:02:34.627
THAT WERE AT TUCKER'S HOUSE,

00:02:34.628 --> 00:02:35.828
THEY'RE NEVER GOING TO LISTEN TO

00:02:35.829 --> 00:02:37.630
US BECAUSE THEY DON'T HAVE A

00:02:37.631 --> 00:02:37.931
LIFE.

