THEIR LIFE IS THIS.

00:02:39.466 --> 00:02:40.466
THEIR LIFE IS ANTAGONISM.

00:02:40.467 --> 00:02:43.203
WE CAN SAY WE HAVE TO TAMP IT

00:02:43.204 --> 00:02:44.204
